        "link": "https://world.digimoncard.com/rule/?card_no=BT17-085#qaResult_card",
        "num": 1,
        "text": "Official English Q&A for BT17-085 (Sep. 6, 2024)"
      }
    ],
    "rulings": [
      {
        "answer": "Yes, you can.  The effect reads \"may digivolve,\" so you can choose whether or not to digivolve.",
        "question": "Can I use this card's [Main] effect to place this Tamer and 1 [Kyubimon] and 1 [Taomon] from my trash as my [Renamon]'s bottom digivolution cards, but then choose to not digivolve into [Sakuyamon]?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "No, you can't.  EX4-030 [Kuzuhamon] is treated as if it has [Sakuyamon]. This effect doesn't treat it as if it has the name [Sakuyamon], therefore digivolution isn't possible.",
        "question": "Can I use this card's [Main] effect to digivolve 1 of my [Renamon] into EX4-030 [Kuzuhamon]?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      }
    ]
  },
